  "question": {
    "text": "The equation of the tangent to the curve $y=x+\\frac{4}{x^2}$, that is parallel to the $x$-axis, is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "\n$y=1$\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$y=2$\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$y=3$\n",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$y=0$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Parallel to $x$-axis $\\quad \\Rightarrow \\frac{d y}{d x}=0 \\quad \\Rightarrow 1-\\frac{8}{x^3}=0$ $\\Rightarrow x=2 \\quad \\Rightarrow y=3$\nEquation of tangent is $y-3=0(x-2) \\quad \\Rightarrow y-3=0$"
  }
}